        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "KCxxu",
          "name": "Main Reading Area",
          "clip": true,
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "padding": [
            31.260000228881836,
            20,
            59.5,
            20
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "N8IzT0",
              "name": "Article",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 26.100000381469727,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "oU2hJ",
                  "name": "Container",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "padding": [
                    0,
                    0,
                    0.6499999761581421,
                    0
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "ed9Fk",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "#000000ff",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Two of the most important\ncharacteristics of good design are\ndiscoverability and understanding.\nDiscoverability: Is it possible to even\nfigure out what actions are possible and\nwhere and how to perform them?\nUnderstanding: What does it all mean?\nHow is the product supposed to be\nused? What do all the different controls\nand settings mean?",
                      "lineHeight": 1.8000000847710504,
                      "textAlignVertical": "middle",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "i3wcu",
                  "name": "Container",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "height": 260.0299987792969,
                  "layout": "none",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "QXe8L",
                      "x": 0,
                      "y": -0.014999999664723873,
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "#000000ff",
                      "content": "The complexity of modern devices is not\nnecessarily bad: complexity is often\nrequired to match the complexity of the\ntasks. ",
                      "lineHeight": 1.8000000847710504,
                      "textAlignVertical": "middle",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "cBdtH",
                      "x": 0,
                      "y": 101.06999969482422,
                      "name": "Paragraph+Overlay+HorizontalBorder",
                      "width": 336.6400146484375,
                      "height": 59.38999938964844,
                      "fill": "#f472b610",
                      "stroke": "#f472b6ff",
                      "strokeWidth": {
                        "bottom": 2
                      },
                      "strokeAlignment": "inner",
                      "strokeLinejoin": "round",
                      "layout": "none",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "vevFl",
                          "x": 55.220001220703125,
                          "y": -4,
                          "name": "Text",
                          "fill": "#000000ff",
                          "content": "But we don't need the confusion.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.8000000847710504,
                          "textAlignVertical": "middle",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 18,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "ttKot",
                          "x": 0,
                          "y": 28.389999389648438,
                          "name": "Text",
                          "fill": "#000000ff",
                          "content": "Complexity is good; confusion is bad.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.8000000847710504,
                          "textAlignVertical": "middle",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 18,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "fHavM",
                      "x": 0,
                      "y": 161.74000549316406,
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "#000000ff",
                      "content": "The role of the designer is to help people\nmanage the complexity, to make it\nunderstandable.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.8000000847710504,
                      "textAlignVertical": "middle",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "RQziE",
                  "name": "Container",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "padding": [
                    0,
                    0,
                    0.6700000166893005,
                    0
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "V9eNo",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "#000000ff",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "When we interact with a product, we\nneed to figure out how to work it. This\nmeans discovering what it does, how it\nworks, and what operations are possible:\ndiscoverability.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.8000000847710504,
                      "textAlignVertical": "middle",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "jcRFH",
                  "name": "Container",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "padding": [
                    0,
                    0,
                    0.6650000214576721,
                    0
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Rq9t7",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "#000000ff",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Discoverability results from appropriate\napplication of five fundamental\npsychological concepts: affordances,\nsignifiers, constraints, mappings, and\nfeedback.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.8000000847710504,
                      "textAlignVertical": "middle",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "a4lzLf",
                  "name": "Container",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "GXMKH",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "#000000ff",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "But there is a sixth principle, perhaps\nmost important of all: the conceptual\nmodel of the system. It is the conceptual\nmodel that provides true understanding.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.8000000847710504,
                      "textAlignVertical": "middle",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
